Turns on Chrome's password generation, which it offers only while passwords sync to a Google
account, which ilo never signs in to: its popup on a new-password field offers Use Strong Password
and Choose Your Own, and the password it generates is saved in the profile's own store, as a typed
one is. Its words say so, in place of Google Password Manager and an account's email
(docs/ux-spec.md, Passwords and autofill). Agents get none: generation follows
IsSavingAndFillingEnabled(), which chromium-core-agent-no-autofill.patch turns off in an agent's
tab.

